.TH TWODRIVE-DAEMON 1 "October 2026" "TwoDrive" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
twodrive-daemon \- run the TwoDrive mount and background synchronization
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B twodrive-daemon
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs the configured OneDrive mount and optional known-folder backup workers
for the current user. Configure and sign in with twodrive first.
The package installs a user service but does not enable or start it.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR twodrive (1),
.BR systemctl (1)
